sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CompanyPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UploadCompanyLogoBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UploadCompanyLogoController
  participant StorageService as «control»<br/>StorageService
  participant DesignerCompany as «entity»<br/>DesignerCompany
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: upload my company logo
  UI->>B: POST /api/designer/company/logo (JWT)
  B->>C: upload(Integer designerId, MultipartFile file)
  alt not JPEG/PNG/WebP or > 5 MB
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>StorageService: store()
  StorageService-->>C: result
  C->>DesignerCompany: save()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CompanyResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end